{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的 S09 用“甚至愿意再受那些气”把人物动机说得偏实，Y 的“只想在难受的时候有人陪着”更克制，也更贴近那一刻的犹疑。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 用【】把每段叙事的关键转折直接标出来，感受又按照音乐进程分批出现，观众更容易先抓住主线，再听出情绪怎样变化。Y 的右侧短词常把不同阶段的感受堆在一起，虽然有不少好词，却不容易迅速辨认情绪发展的先后。X 更容易让人把整首曲子的情感连成一件事：离开、怀念、动摇、辨清自己真正需要什么，最后带着想念继续向前。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f1f88f56-3fef-4ed1-b58e-e1a85834f580", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005312331388Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:54:36.906748+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a4c34a2b37ad3f98064454cddee3fa1fcc186470fee1a377a0264fb8f73c2ef8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py